# =============================================================================
#  SME.orch - Speak Model with Emotion (CAE-USC V2.5)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module, which executes by exchange. Emotionless speech takes
#  the emotion of a MODEL UTTERANCE by its prosody: Speech Feature Analysis 1 extracts
#  the prosodic features of the model utterance (given the Mode Selector), and
#  Prosodic Emotion Insertion applies them to the emotionless speech. The User Agent
#  offers each datum to its Port, by Data Type and Port Number, from the device the
#  App gave it.
# =============================================================================

workflow SME over 1CAE-SME-V2.5-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    offer   ModeSelector     (OSD-SEL-V1.5:1) from device "ModeSelector"
    offer   Model            (OSD-BSO-V1.5:1) from device "Model"
    offer   Speech           (OSD-BSO-V1.5:2) from device "Speech"

    ask     Result           (OSD-BSO-V1.5:1)
    present Result

on Stop:
    ask Controller to stop
